OL,3,ATower block residents plagued by
OL,4,Aintruders in scaffolding 'nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a north London tower block
OL,7,Fsaid they are living a "nightmare",
OL,8,Fwith intruders accessing the
OL,9,Fscaffolding that has surrounded their
OL,10,Fhomes for the past six years.
OL,12,FThe scaffolding was erected at Archway
OL,13,FHeights in 2020 as a precautionary
OL,14,Fmeasure after a piece of external
OL,15,Fcladding fell off, according to the
OL,16,Fhousing association, People for Places.
OL,18,FIt said it was waiting for approval
OL,19,Ffrom the Building Safety Regulator
OL,20,F(BSR) to begin repairs.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
